  "All rects are source pixels = layout units. Top-level rects absolute; template parts relative.",
  "header carries the throne painting only; the three currency pills are inpainted out and come from chrome/.",
  "identity_plate has name, level and xp text erased; the lion crest and quill button stay baked.",
  "stats_strip is one image holding the three cells; only the numbers are erased.",
  "gear_panel keeps YOUR GEAR, the ornament line, EQUIP BEST and the three tiles baked; the tiles are re-drawn over the same rects from items/ so an equipped item can change. gear_tile_empty is an inpainted frame for an empty slot (not in the reference).",
  "upgrade_card is the GRANARY card with painting, name, level and bonus text erased so any upgrade can be shown; granary_art is the painting. Only a MAX LEVEL button exists in the reference \u2014 a purchasable upgrade has no button art here; reuse btn_max_level's plate with live text if needed (its label is baked).",
  "family_sword/armor/horse under items/ include their gold frame, red gem and the Lv badge plate; the badge number is erased."
 ],
